  "description": "The base of the synthetic data generators: a story model (Story, Person, Prescription, DrugProduct, LabDraw) with every date a StoryDay relative to one as-of date, deterministic seeded values (Seeded), and HarCapture, the synthetic defaults a generated Chrome DevTools capture is built with on http-archive's ChromeHar. Per-source generator packages build on it. Pure — no DOM, no fs, no React.",
